#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:2
msgid "架构与可扩展性"
msgstr "Architecture and Scalability"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:4
msgid "本页介绍 AgentSociety 2 的运行时架构，以及它如何在较大规模的仿真中组织智能体、环境、LLM 调用、 trace 和 replay 存储。"
msgstr ""
"This page describes the AgentSociety 2 runtime architecture and how it organizes "
"agents, environments, LLM calls, trace data, and replay storage for larger-scale "
"simulations."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:7
msgid ""
"AgentSociety 2 将智能体状态放在独立 workspace 中，执行时再由 Ray Task 按批重建和推进智能体。环境路由、LLM 调度、trace、replay "
"等运行时组件作为共享服务存在，通过 ``ServiceProxy`` 注入到每个智能体。这样做的目标是让智能体数量可以随实验规模增长，而不是为每个智能体长期保留一个进程或 actor。"
msgstr ""
"AgentSociety 2 stores agent state in independent workspaces. During execution, Ray Tasks rebuild "
"and advance agents in batches. Runtime components such as environment routing, LLM dispatch, "
"trace, and replay run as shared services and are injected into each agent through "
"``ServiceProxy``. The goal is to let the number of agents grow with experiment scale instead of "
"keeping a long-lived process or actor for every agent."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:13
msgid "执行模型"
msgstr "Execution Model"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:13
msgid ""
"每个 ``AgentBase`` 子类的持久状态都保存在自己的 workspace 中，包括 ``config.json``、``AGENT.json``、 "
"``TODO.json``、``MEMORY.md``、``memory/`` 和 ``state/``。智能体对象只是在一次任务执行期间从这些文件重建出来的运行时对象；一次 "
"``step()`` 结束后，新的状态会写回 workspace。"
msgstr ""
"Each ``AgentBase`` subclass persists its state in its workspace, including ``config.json``, "
"``AGENT.json``, ``TODO.json``, ``MEMORY.md``, ``memory/``, and ``state/``. The agent object is "
"reconstructed from these files for a task; after each ``step()``, updated state is written back "
"to the workspace."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:16
msgid ""
"这一模型对应 :doc:`agents` 中的 ``create`` / ``from_workspace`` / ``to_workspace`` "
"契约。对调度器来说，一个智能体可以表示为轻量的执行说明：workspace 路径、智能体类型、智能体 id，以及共享的 ``ServiceProxy`` 句柄。Ray worker "
"收到任务后在本地调用 ``from_workspace``，运行 ``step``，再调用 ``to_workspace`` 持久化结果。智能体对象本身不会在 Ray object store "
"中来回传递。"
msgstr ""
"This model matches the ``create`` / ``from_workspace`` / ``to_workspace`` contract described in "
":doc:`agents`. To the scheduler, an agent can be represented as a lightweight execution spec: "
"workspace path, agent type, agent id, and a shared ``ServiceProxy`` handle. After a Ray worker "
"receives a task, it calls ``from_workspace`` locally, runs ``step``, and then calls "
"``to_workspace`` to persist the result. The agent object itself is not passed back and forth "
"through the Ray object store."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:20
msgid ""
"环境模块使用一套对称的持久化契约：``EnvBase.to_workspace()`` 负责写出动态状态， ``restore()`` 负责恢复。每个模块可以选择自己的状态格式，通常把文件放在 "
"``<workspace_root>/state/ENV_STATE.json``。路由会在每步结束时调用 ``to_workspaces()``；使用 ``--resume`` 时，actor"
" 的 ``init()`` 会通过 ``from_workspaces()`` 重建各模块。恢复发生在模块 ``init()`` 之后，因此 checkpoint "
"中的状态会覆盖初始化时的重置。``AgentSociety`` 自身的状态写入 ``SOCIETY.json`` 和 ``SOCIETY_STEP.json``。详见 "
":doc:`env_modules` 与 :doc:`cli` 的 resume 说明。"
msgstr ""
"Environment modules use a symmetric persistence contract: ``EnvBase.to_workspace()`` writes "
"dynamic state, and ``restore()`` restores it. Each module can choose its own state format, and "
"usually stores the file at ``<workspace_root>/state/ENV_STATE.json``. The router calls "
"``to_workspaces()`` at the end of each step. When ``--resume`` is used, the actor's ``init()`` "
"rebuilds modules through ``from_workspaces()``. Restoration happens after the module ``init()``, "
"so checkpointed state overrides initialization-time resets. ``AgentSociety`` stores its own state"
" in ``SOCIETY.json`` and ``SOCIETY_STEP.json``. See :doc:`env_modules` and the resume section in "
":doc:`cli` for details."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:32
msgid "``AgentSociety`` 在每个 tick 中执行以下流程："
msgstr "For each tick, ``AgentSociety`` performs the following flow:"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:34
msgid "将智能体 id 切成若干批。"
msgstr "Split agent ids into batches."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:35
msgid "为每一批提交一个 ``step_agent_batch`` Ray Task。"
msgstr "Submit one ``step_agent_batch`` Ray Task for each batch."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:36
msgid "每个 task 在批内用 ``asyncio.gather`` 并发推进智能体；批之间由 Ray 调度到不同 worker。"
msgstr ""
"Within each task, advance agents concurrently with ``asyncio.gather``; across "
"batches, Ray schedules work onto different workers."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:37
msgid "所有批次完成后，调用环境的 ``step``，再推进仿真时钟。"
msgstr ""
"After all batches complete, call the environment ``step`` and then advance the "
"simulation clock."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:32
msgid ""
"默认批大小为 ``AGENTSOCIETY_BATCH_SIZE=256``（CLI ``--batch-size`` 可覆盖）。每 tick 提交的 Ray Task 数为 ⌈N / "
"批大小⌉；同时执行的数量由 Ray 资源预算与调度决定。 ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_RAY_MAX_WORKERS`` 配置 Ray 的 CPU 预算，不会减少已提交的批次数。单个 "
"task 内的并发由批大小和本地 ``LLMClient`` 的 AIMD 控制器共同影响。"
msgstr ""
"The default batch size is ``AGENTSOCIETY_BATCH_SIZE=256`` (overridden by CLI ``--batch-size``). "
"Each tick submits ⌈N / batch size⌉ Ray tasks; concurrent execution depends on the Ray resource "
"budget and scheduler. ``AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_RAY_MAX_WORKERS`` configures the Ray CPU budget without "
"reducing submitted batches. Per-task concurrency also depends on batch size and the local "
"``LLMClient`` AIMD controller."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:43
msgid "Ray 按批调度，智能体从 workspace 重建并写回状态"
msgstr "Ray schedules batches; agents are restored from and persisted to workspaces"

