#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:86
msgid ""
"``ServiceProxy`` 只保存可序列化的句柄和配置，不保存锁、连接池或后台线程。Ray Task 因此只需要接收一个服务容器；环境 router、trace 与 replay 由 "
"driver 或 CLI 统一创建，LLM client 只携带连接参数， worker 在自己的事件循环中按需创建 litellm Router 和并发控制器。"
msgstr ""
"``ServiceProxy`` stores only serializable handles and configuration. It does not store locks, "
"connection pools, or background threads. A Ray Task therefore only needs to receive one service "
"container. The environment router, trace, and replay are created once by the driver or CLI; the "
"LLM client only carries connection parameters, and workers create the litellm Router and "
"concurrency controller on demand in their own event loop."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:99
msgid "环境路由"
msgstr "Environment Routing"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:101
msgid ""
"环境状态由环境路由统一管理。生产运行时，CLI 会通过 ``get_env_router_actor_class`` 创建专用的 Ray actor，并把 "
"``EnvRouterProxy`` 放入 ``ServiceProxy``。智能体通过该 proxy 调用 ``ask``、 ``step``、``init`` 和 "
"``get_world_description`` 等接口；所有智能体看到的是同一份环境状态。"
msgstr ""
"Environment state is managed by the environment router. In production runtime, the "
"CLI creates a dedicated Ray actor through ``get_env_router_actor_class`` and places "
"an ``EnvRouterProxy`` in ``ServiceProxy``. Agents call ``ask``, ``step``, ``init``, "
"``get_world_description``, and related interfaces through that proxy; all agents see "
"the same environment state."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:96
msgid ""
"actor 的 ``max_concurrency`` 取决于挂载模块是否全部声明 ``is_concurrency_safe()``：全部安全时使用 "
"``AGENTSOCIETY_ENV_ACTOR_MAX_CONCURRENCY``（默认 64），否则为 ``1``。全部模块安全时 ``CodeGenRouter`` "
"跳过全局执行锁；非安全栈串行执行。详见 :doc:`env_modules`。"
msgstr ""
"The actor ``max_concurrency`` depends on whether all mounted modules declare "
"``is_concurrency_safe()``. If so, it uses ``AGENTSOCIETY_ENV_ACTOR_MAX_CONCURRENCY`` (default: "
"64); otherwise, it uses ``1``. ``CodeGenRouter`` skips the global execution lock when all modules"
" are safe; unsafe stacks execute serially. See :doc:`env_modules`."

