#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:196
msgid "Trace"
msgstr "Trace"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:198
msgid ":mod:`agentsociety2.trace` 提供分布式追踪，采用分布式无锁写入，没有中心 actor："
msgstr ""
":mod:`agentsociety2.trace` provides distributed tracing with lock-free, distributed "
"writes and no central actor:"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:188
msgid ""
"``ShardedAppendSink``（别名 ``ShardedTraceWriter``）按 ``trace_id[:2]`` 分片（最多 256 个文件），每个写进程持有自己的实例，以 "
"``os.open(O_APPEND)`` + ``os.write`` 追加记录，不经过中心写入 actor。共享目录的并发写入语义还取决于底层文件系统，不能用管道的 ``PIPE_BUF``"
" 保证推断普通文件的行为。"
msgstr ""
"``ShardedAppendSink`` (alias ``ShardedTraceWriter``) shards by ``trace_id[:2]`` into at most 256 "
"files. Each writer process holds its own instance and appends records using ``os.open(O_APPEND)``"
" and ``os.write``, without a central writer actor. Concurrent shared-directory writes depend on "
"the filesystem; pipe ``PIPE_BUF`` guarantees do not establish regular-file behavior."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:203
msgid ""
"``JsonlTraceWriter`` 提供 ``start_span``、``trace_span``、``record_event``、``end_span`` 和"
" ``TraceSpan``，把完成的 span 转发给 sink。"
msgstr ""
"``JsonlTraceWriter`` provides ``start_span``, ``trace_span``, ``record_event``, "
"``end_span``, and ``TraceSpan``, forwarding completed spans to the sink."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:205
msgid ""
"``TraceProxy`` 是放入 ``ServiceProxy`` 的轻量句柄，只携带 trace 目录；各消费者在本地自建 "
"``ShardedAppendSink``。"
msgstr ""
"``TraceProxy`` is the lightweight handle placed into ``ServiceProxy``; it carries "
"only the trace directory, and each consumer builds its own local "
"``ShardedAppendSink``."

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:194
msgid "智能体执行、memory、环境调用和 LLM 调用都可以记录为 span。运行完成后，trace 数据可用于分析慢调用、长尾任务和环境工具调用瓶颈。"
msgstr ""
"Agent execution, memory, environment calls, and LLM calls can all be recorded as spans. After a "
"run completes, trace data can be used to analyze slow calls, tail-latency tasks, and environment "
"tool-call bottlenecks."

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:212
msgid "Replay 与存储"
msgstr "Replay and Storage"

#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/architecture.rst:214
msgid ""
"Replay 数据由 ``ReplaySink`` / ``ReplayWriter`` 以 append-only JSONL 写入 "
"``run/replay/``，dataset catalog 和列元数据保存在 ``_schema.json``。``ReplayProxy`` 只携带 replay "
"目录和启用标志；env router、society 和 agent task 各自在本进程内创建 ``ReplaySink`` 并并发 append，不再经过中心 "
"SQLite actor。读取侧由 ``ReplayReader`` 使用 DuckDB 将 JSONL shard 注册为 view，表结构与数据集注册机制见 "
":doc:`storage`。"
msgstr ""
"Replay data is written by ``ReplaySink`` / ``ReplayWriter`` as append-only JSONL "
"under ``run/replay/``. The dataset catalog and column metadata are stored in "
"``_schema.json``. ``ReplayProxy`` only carries the replay directory and enabled flag;"
" the env router, society, and agent tasks each create a local ``ReplaySink`` in their"
" own process and append concurrently, without a central SQLite actor. On the read "
"side, ``ReplayReader`` uses DuckDB to register JSONL shards as views. For table "
"structure and dataset registration, see :doc:`storage`."

